      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "7d6dea8fbd5a846d278cd0e83d843580d1a80a6bb4e5edc321818e117ac592bc:000002_6592479388365870427:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ん～～っ……風が気持ちいいですね！\nエテジアさん、誘ってくれてありがとうございます！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "371596875a7b6b0308aa8e589d88d4d81372a81c36cd99e214bf47806d5b7e6d",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "お礼なんていいのよ、ご主人さま。\n私があなたと一緒に来たかったのだから。\nこの場所を気に入ってくれたなら嬉しいわ。",
      "jp_sha256": "78541518a5d91ac67fb38d5be2920c850d05a60a01a4f69abc63136397ef5afc",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "고맙다는 말은 됐어, 주인님.\n내가 당신과 함께 오고 싶었던 거니까.\n이곳이 마음에 들었다면 기쁘네.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 38,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "7d6dea8fbd5a846d278cd0e83d843580d1a80a6bb4e5edc321818e117ac592bc:000002_6592479388365870427:g0:r37",
      "row_index_0based": 37,
      "serialized_row_index": 37,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "エテジア",
        "Emt4_Enj",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "お礼なんていいのよ、ご主人さま。\n私があなたと一緒に来たかったのだから。\nこの場所を気に入ってくれたなら嬉しいわ。",
        "",
        "ch_10001/R18/10001B0_10001_Nml/10001B0_10001_001",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "エテジア",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10001/R18/10001B0_10001_Nml/10001B0_10001_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "3c85f21f574d524d0fd8ccceb3cdb79d14feedb1a088fc20e2e57c63272f6ea8",
